title: "@three-ws/x402-mcp"
abstract: "Give any AI agent a self-custodial x402 wallet. Search the live bazaar, inspect an endpoint's price without paying, and pay_and_call any x402 service in USDC or $THREE from your own Solana key — real @x402 settlement, bounded by spend caps. No custodial wallet, no account."
